# Keep LF endings on files whose bytes we compare or execute: the embedded
# skill snapshot is compared byte-exactly (include_str! of skill/**/*.md AND
# skill/**/agents/openai.yaml — see skill_snapshot_check), and shell scripts
# break under CRLF. Windows checkouts must not vary any of them.
*.md text eol=lf
*.sh text eol=lf
*.yaml text eol=lf
*.yml text eol=lf
*.sql text eol=lf
